{"4293830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pal Party", "steam_appid": 4293830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fast-paced local multiplayer party game. In dozens of carefully designed physics levels, 2-4 players will engage in intense battles - from life and death racing, maze breakouts, team fights to extreme survival, and more. Each game lasts up to 3 minutes, with a tight pace and constant laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹  Diverse gameplay: Each level is a brand new challenge - avoiding spinning traps, bombs, and collapsing floors... The rules are constantly changing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹  One game determines the winner: only one champion is selected in each level, or all players are eliminated. There is no resurrection, only the ultimate test of strategy and operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹  Pure skill confrontation: No character growth, no numerical cultivation, victory or defeat depends on advance positioning prediction, use of props, and on-site reaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹  Local Fun+Remote Play: Supports local screen battles, and can also connect with friends across regions through Steam Remote Play Together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single game lasts for 3 minutes, but one game after another cannot be stopped! Suitable for friend gatherings, family entertainment, or live streaming activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly reminder: The game process may lead to table slapping, screaming, and a vicious cycle of &quot;another round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends for a friend to friend party in multiple levels! GG was played amidst laughter and joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinlin